  "plain": "Between 2021 and 2024, James Valor of Skywatcher, a startup that says it tries to summon UFOs, says he held secret, \"spy vs. spy\" style meetings with the scientist Garry Nolan and with congressional staff. He tells Michels he took part himself, and that at one meeting he set things up so Nolan \"felt very inconvenient\". He also names a man called Alex and Jake Barber, a man linked to these claims, as part of the story, which shows how cautious these behind-the-scenes contacts were."
